Optimization list (data/optimization.json)
-------------------------------------------
Parts of the optimization list are based on the configuration data of the
Windows Desktop Optimization Tool (WDOT):

  Repository : https://github.com/The-Virtual-Desktop-Team/Windows-Desktop-Optimization-Tool
  Licence    : MIT License
  Copyright  : Copyright (c) 2025 The Virtual Desktop Team

Only facts are taken over (names of Windows services, scheduled tasks, AppX
packages, autologgers and registry values). The selection, the explanations,
the risk notes and the undo logic are AVDTune's own. No WDOT script code is
copied and WDOT is neither downloaded nor run by AVDTune.

